OpenStory JavaScript Catalog development fixture notice

The metadata, names, descriptions, and JSON fixture content in this bundled development
catalog are synthetic OpenStory project test data and are not copied from a third-party
catalog or website. No third-party credentials, API keys, or copyrighted catalog data are
included in this package.

The project-wide open-source license will be selected and committed during the release
hardening wave. Until then, this notice documents provenance for the bundled fixture and
does not grant rights beyond the license governing the repository that contains it.
